---
// Consulting differentiators as white cards.
const reasons = [
  {
    title: "Two people, no handoffs",
    description:
      "The people who scope the work are the people who spec it and build it. No account managers, no junior team learning on your dime.",
  },
  {
    title: "40+ years combined",
    description:
      "Senior hardware and software experience across industrial systems, embedded development, and manufacturing.",
  },
  {
    title: "Vendor-neutral",
    description:
      "We don't sell hardware. Recommendations are ranked by payback, not commission — if the right fix is a $200 sensor, that's the proposal.",
  },
  {
    title: "Right-sized fixes",
    description:
      "Sometimes it's a full automation cell. Often it's a changeover tweak or an interlock. You get the smallest fix that pays, not the biggest one that sells.",
  },
];
---
<section id="why" class="bg-page py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">

    <div class="mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-accent mb-3">Why Frontier</p>
      <h2 class="text-ink font-bold mb-4" style="font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 44px);">Worth the call</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-[16px] leading-relaxed">
        A small firm on purpose. You talk to the people doing the work, and the advice
        isn't attached to a hardware catalogue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
      {reasons.map((r, i) => (
        <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-bold text-accent block mb-3">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <h3 class="text-ink font-semibold text-[18px] mb-2.5">{r.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed">{r.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
